r why are  you getting upset i have read curly hair  now griffin's real human form as a  balding pot-bellied middle-aged man  caused a bit of a stir among some hotel  transylvania fans when the movie's  trailer came out over 30 000 people  signed a petition on behalf of the  invisible man simps community asking  sony animation to make griffin hot and  it's possible the filmmakers give a  little nod to this because they actually  snuck an alternate version of griffin  into the final movie to catch this watch  really carefully during the crystal cave  scene because as broken reflections of  each character appear in the giant  crystals when griffin wanders into view  in the corner there's a design of him  that looks completely different  including a full head of hair don't be  so uptight i'm in viz man just because  you're invisible doesn't mean you get to  be naked gremlin air makes a hilarious  return for the fourth movie and there's  a bit of humorous lamp shading that  acknowledges how ridiculous it is that  the plane can actually fly how is this  plane even in the sky is that duct tape  holding the wing together  after arriving in south america johnny  and drak take a bus to the amazon but  when johnny's monster size slows it down  he decides to move the vehicle along by  picking it up and running with it a  shout out to the old school animation  the flintstones where fred and his  friend barney would sometimes use foot  power to literally run their car  there's a long-running joke in the  franchise that drak supposedly goes  round saying blah blah blah yes fellow  dracula there's only one way blah blah  blah i do not say blah blah blah blah  blah blah i don't know where that comes  from and it's true that according to  vampires.com dracula has never said the  phrase either in the books or the  live-action movies that came before the  animated movie franchise however in  hotel transylvania 4 as drak tries to  explain why he made up the monster real  estate law he 